invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.c
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_test
reason: a resumed session names its own PSK, the presented ticket's, as
  the trust of each ticket it receives, where it owes that ticket's trust,
  the pin. The next resumption then holds no such trust and is refused.
  test/tcp_nonblocking_resume_tests.h resumes the ticket a resumed session
  received.

--- old
    if (t->cfg.ticket != NULL) {
        memcpy(out, t->cfg.ticket->ticket.trust_hash, SHA256_LEN);
        return;
    }
--- new
